  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "After deleting the impostor for an avatar then generating an imposter again, the new impostor will not appear in-game until the player viewing the avatar clears their cache and relaunches the game.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n- View avatar\n\n- Avatar author deletes and regenerates impostors for this avatar\n\n- View avatar impostor — it will remain the same impostor as before",
